<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Mod id="a094e5e3-d7d8-48fb-9d64-9f587bb1780f" version="3">
  <Properties>
    <Name>Empire State Building Wonder</Name>
    <Teaser>Long New York's tallest building, the Empire State Building was constructed during the Great Depression in a competition</Teaser>
    <Description>Long New York's tallest building, the Empire State Building was constructed over eighty years ago during a competition with two other New York skyscrapers, The Chrysler Building and 40 Wall Street, for the title of New York's tallest building, a title which the Empire State Building won. The building took place in the midst of the Great Depression, and became a sign of hope for the city. It also featured a spire which was originally intended to be used as a mooring for Airships, however this was scrapped as it was impossible for the craft to sucessfully dock. Ingame, the Empire State Building provides +35% [ICON_GOLD] Gold from [ICON_CONNECTED] City Connections, and +8 [ICON_GOLD] Gold upon discovering Flight, while it requires Electronics.</Description>
    <Authors>Pouakai, sukritact</Authors>
    <SpecialThanks>ambrox62, Mentos, Moriboe</SpecialThanks>
    <HideSetupGame>0</HideSetupGame>
    <AffectsSavedGames>1</AffectsSavedGames>
